# DS-0002 / AVD-DS-0002: Image user should not be 'root'
# - frontend/Dockerfile: Nginx master process starts as root to bind port 80
#   and manage system PID/cache directories, then automatically drops worker process
#   privileges to the unprivileged 'nginx' user (as configured in nginx.conf).
# - backend/Dockerfile: Root privileges are required to configure OS-level process
#   isolation namespaces (bubblewrap/seccomp) for untrusted plugins.
DS-0002
AVD-DS-0002
